# Verification gates

Run the smallest tier that covers the change.

- **Tier 1** — copy/content only (`src/content/**`, strings, docs): `npx tsc --noEmit` + eslint on touched files. No build, no e2e.
- **Tier 2** — one component/page: Tier 1 + `npm run build` + only the matching spec(s) (e.g. `npx playwright test e2e/home.spec.ts`).
- **Tier 3** — shared surface (nav, layout, routing, forms, Spray/tokens, middleware) or when the prompt says "full gates": Tier 1 + build + full `npm run test:e2e`.

## Probe scripts

No `/tmp` probe scripts unless the prompt asks for them.

## Report

Which tier ran, pass/fail per gate, nothing else. No screenshots unless asked.
